#. type: Content of: <svg><g><text><tspan>
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/images/combat/retreat-blocked.svg:1622
#, no-wrap
msgid "front unit to move back.  In practise, a "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <svg><g><text><tspan>
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/images/combat/retreat-blocked.svg:1625
#, no-wrap
msgid "retreat of such a large distance would "
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <svg><g><text><tspan>
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/images/combat/retreat-blocked.svg:1628
#, no-wrap
msgid "result in casualties, but we've left all"
